## Development Workflow

### End of Longer Sessions (REQUIRED)

Always run these commands before completing longer development sessions:

1. `yarn validate` - Check types, linting, and dependencies
2. Only run it at the very end

### Cleanup Checklist

- Remove any temporary/debug files created during development
- Update relevant tests if behavior changed
- Check for unused imports or variables
- Verify consistent code formatting

## Constraints

- Don't be overly strict about linting issues unless they affect functionality
- Focus on mobile UX patterns, not responsive web design
- App is portrait-only mobile application
- No tablet support (iOS supportsTablet: false)
- Prefer simple implementations over complex engineering
- Maintain existing architecture patterns

